sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant API as Order API
  participant DB as Orders DB
  participant R as Outbox relay
  participant B as Broker
  participant C as Consumer
  participant I as Consumer inbox
  API->>DB: one transaction: insert order + insert outbox row
  R->>DB: poll unpublished outbox rows
  R->>B: publish(OrderPlaced, id=evt-42)
  B-->>R: ack
  R->>DB: mark evt-42 published
  Note over R,B: A crash between publish and mark causes a re-publish: at-least-once
  B->>C: deliver evt-42
  C->>I: insert evt-42 (unique key)
  alt first delivery
    C->>C: apply side effect in the same transaction
    C-->>B: ack
  else duplicate
    I-->>C: unique violation → already processed
    C-->>B: ack (no side effect)
  end
